  "description": "<h3 class=\"heading h3\" style=\"display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: var(--heading-font-weight); color: rgb(var(--heading-color)); font-size: var(--heading-h3-font-size); line-height: 1.11111; margin: 0px 0px 24px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"opacity: 1; display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\">BIOMECHANICAL PRODUCTS</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text-wrapper\" style=\"opacity: 1; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(46, 46, 46); font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px;\">Floky products are unique because they are&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-weight: var(--text-font-bold-weight); box-sizing: border-box;\">the only ones in the world to exploit the principles of biomechanics&nbsp;</strong>to help athletes achieve their goals.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;\">Stablize your muscles and ligaments before injury rather than after</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;\">Reduce blisters</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;\">Improve recovery time&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"heading h3\" style=\"display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: var(--heading-font-weight); color: rgb(var(--heading-color)); font-size: var(--heading-h3-font-size); line-height: 1.11111; margin: 0px 0px 24px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"opacity: 1; display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\">BIOMECHANICS APPLIED TO</span><span style=\"opacity: 1; display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\">THE HUMAN BODY</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text-wrapper\" style=\"opacity: 1; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(46, 46, 46); font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px;\">Biomechanics is&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-weight: var(--text-font-bold-weight); box-sizing: border-box;\">the science that studies human movement&nbsp;</strong>to optimize it, making physical exercise not only more pleasant, but also healthy and free from the risk of injury. At Floky we exploit the principles of biomechanics <strong style=\"font-weight: var(--text-font-bold-weight); box-sizing: border-box;\">to</strong><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"> improve and protect your performance.</span></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
